# Bees Motion deploy workflow

After completing requested website changes in this repo (`meklads/beesmotion`):

1. **Commit** with a clear message (HEREDOC) when there are relevant changes.
2. **Push to GitHub** on `main` with `git push origin main` immediately — never ask “هل أرفع؟” / “should I push?”.
3. **Deploy** with `npm run deploy` from `website/` so production stays in sync.

Do not leave finished work only local. Only pause if blocked (auth, hooks, secrets). If push/deploy fails, fix and retry or tell the user why.
